<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel><title>KevinHu&#39;s Website</title><link>https://devhiker.xyz/</link><atom:link href="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /><managingEditor>kevinHu</managingEditor><docs>https://github.com/kevinhuky/kevinhuky.github.io</docs><language>en</language> <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 06:45:50 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 06:45:50 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.17.3</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>KevinHu's Website</title><link>https://devhiker.xyz/</link> </image> <item> <title>Spring Boot 最佳实践与常用技巧</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>Engineering</category> <category>终生学习</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;本文总结 Spring Boot 开发中的最佳实践，涵盖项目结构、配置管理、异常处理、日志规范、性能优化等方面，帮助开发者构建更健壮、更易维护的应用程序。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/07/15/spring-boot-best-practices/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 06:45:51 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/07/15/spring-boot-best-practices/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Redis 缓存策略与常见问题解决方案</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>Engineering</category> <category>终生学习</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;Redis 是最流行的内存数据库之一，广泛用于缓存、会话管理、排行榜等场景。本文深入讲解 Redis 缓存策略、数据结构选型、以及缓存穿透、击穿、雪崩等常见问题的解决方案。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/09/01/redis-cache-strategy/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 06:45:51 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/09/01/redis-cache-strategy/</guid> </item> <item> <title>MySQL 索引优化实战指南</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>Engineering</category> <category>终生学习</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;索引是数据库性能优化的重要手段，本文从索引原理出发，详细讲解索引的类型、创建原则、优化技巧以及常见的索引失效场景，帮助你写出更高效的 SQL。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/08/10/mysql-index-optimization/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 06:45:51 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/08/10/mysql-index-optimization/</guid> </item> <item> <title>2025 年度技术复盘：成长、变化与思考</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>终生学习</category> <category>随笔</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;2025 年即将结束，是时候停下脚步，回顾这一年的技术成长、踩过的坑、获得的收获，以及对未来的思考。这不仅是一份总结，更是一次与自己的对话。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/12/31/2025-year-review/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 20 Jan 2026 06:45:51 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/12/31/2025-year-review/</guid> </item> <item> <title>《Effective Java》阅读总结</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>阅读</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;&#34;对《Effective Java》进行阅读提炼，把书读薄，聚焦关键实践与原则，形成便于回顾和应用的笔记。&#34;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/09/09/effective-java/</link> <pubDate>Mon, 22 Sep 2025 19:20:51 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/09/09/effective-java/</guid> </item> <item> <title>RocketMQ 技术笔记</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>Engineering</category> <category>终生学习</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;本文基于 Apache RocketMQ 官方文档，总结核心设计原理与关键技术点，并记录学习过程中遇到的疑问与分析。内容涵盖消息存储模型、消费逻辑、5.x 版本特性等，适合作为个人技术笔记或开发者参考。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/06/27/mq/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 09 Sep 2025 19:33:50 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/06/27/mq/</guid> </item> <item> <title>用 Cursor 有感：AI 编程工具带来的冲击</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>AI</category> <category>随笔</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;随着 AI 编程工具的发展，传统开发方式正在被重塑。程序员的工作还能保有多少“人”的价值？在 AI 逐渐掌握编程技能的时代，我们该何去何从。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/06/29/cursor-experience/</link> <pubDate>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 15:50:11 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/06/29/cursor-experience/</guid> </item> <item> <title>Java 并发编程完全指南</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>Engineering</category> <category>终生学习</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;本文系统总结 Java 并发编程的核心知识点，包括锁机制、CAS、AQS、线程池、并发容器等，帮助深入理解 JUC 包的设计思想与实战应用。&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2024/09/12/juc/</link> <pubDate>Sun, 29 Jun 2025 15:50:11 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2024/09/12/juc/</guid> </item> <item> <title>纸上山河：我的精神角落书单</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>阅读</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;&#34;读书对我而言，是一场无声的对话。这份书单没有高深的理论，只有那些真正让我笑过、思考过或熬夜读完的书。它们像老朋友，在不同阶段给了我不同的力量。如果你也在寻找下一本书，或许这里会有答案。&#34;&lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/06/14/book-list/</link> <pubDate>Fri, 27 Jun 2025 20:19:50 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2025/06/14/book-list/</guid> </item> <item> <title>工作与学习</title> <author>Kangying Hu</author> <category>终生学习</category> <description>&lt;p&gt;本文整理我在学习/工作中接触到的关键概念与术语，涵盖计算机科学、数据库、经济学及软件工程等领域。内容包含名词解释、应用场景及个人理解，持续更新迭代。 &lt;/p&gt;</description><link>https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2024/08/10/code-complete/</link> <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 19:25:00 +0000</pubDate><source url="https://devhiker.xyz/feed_rss_updated.xml">KevinHu's Website</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://devhiker.xyz/blog/2024/08/10/code-complete/</guid> </item> </channel></rss>